cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Kotaru
    given-names: Prasanth
title: "Udaan: quadrotor dynamics and control for cable-suspended payload systems"
abstract: >-
  A Python package of MuJoCo-backed models and geometric controllers for
  quadrotors carrying cable-suspended payloads, covering six systems: a single
  quadrotor, a quadrotor with a cable-suspended point-mass payload, multiple
  quadrotors sharing a point-mass payload, multiple quadrotors sharing a
  rigid-body payload, a quadrotor with a flexible multi-link cable, and multiple
  quadrotors attached in series along a flexible hose. Each system ships with
  analytical dynamics, a MuJoCo backend, a controller and a differential-flatness
  flat-to-state map.
# `version` tracks udaan/__init__.py and pyproject.toml. `date-released` is
